        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♌ The Leo Cloth.</strong> <em>[OFFENSE]</em></p><h3>Cloth Passive — Pride of the Lion</h3><p>You are immune to the frightened condition and to fear effects. You are trained in Intimidation, with a +1 circumstance bonus to Demoralize.</p><h3>Techniques</h3><ul><li><strong>1st &mdash; Signature (L1)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Lightning Bolt]</li><li><strong>2nd (L6)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Lightning Crown]</li><li><strong>3rd &mdash; Cloth Ability (L11)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Lightning Plasma]</li><li><strong>4th &mdash; Ultimate (L16)</strong> — @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Photon Burst]</li></ul><h3>Ascendant Boon — Lightning Plasma <em>[OFFENSE]</em></h3><p>Your fists gain the <strong>agile</strong> trait and deal an additional @Damage[1d6[electricity]] damage.</p><p>You gain a <strong>Haste-style extra action</strong> each turn, usable only to Strike or Stride.</p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Ascendant (Leo)]</p><h3>Zenith Boon — Lightning Plasma (Zenith) <em>[OFFENSE]</em></h3><p>As the Ascendant Boon but with an additional @Damage[3d6[electricity]] damage, and you are <strong>quickened 1</strong> in addition to the Haste action — two extra actions on a Zenith day.</p><p>Applied by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-effects.Item.Sky: Zenith (Leo)]</p>"
